It'll be okay. Just watch over him for a little bit longer.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.650
If you do that, you'll definitely be able to understand him better.

00:21:11.650 --> 00:21:15.890
Um, Saionji-san, are you sure you don't like Itou-kun?

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:18.750
Who knows?

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:35.220
I'll be leaving now.

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:38.270
By bus...or train?

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:50.900
Katsura!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:57.300
I'm glad. I didn't think you'd come.

00:21:57.300 --> 00:22:02.370
Well, I believed that you would, but it's kind of like, yeah...

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:06.550
Katsura!

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:11.640
I swear that I won't do anything you don't like anymore!

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:13.170
I'm sorry.

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:18.500
I want to understand you better, too.

00:22:21.350 --> 00:22:25.040
That's why I'll try my best, too.

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:59.570
I'm your girlfriend, after all. So I want to learn more and more about you.

00:23:00.700 --> 00:23:02.200
Me, too.

00:24:49.420 --> 00:24:53.130
Next Time
Feelings That Brush Past Each Other
